WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.728
This, is Fairy Tale Island.


00:00:23.061 --> 00:00:26.315
A magical land of princes and princesses


00:00:26.816 --> 00:00:28.526
witches and monsters.


00:00:29.443 --> 00:00:33.865
Accidents and strange events
happen all the time.


00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:36.410
And that's when people call us.


00:00:36.785 --> 00:00:41.499
The Fearless Seven, the greatest
heroes on Fairy Tale Island.


00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.834
Especially me, Merlin.


00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:48.464
But everything changed
the day we defeated a dragon


00:00:48.673 --> 00:00:50.383
and saved a Princess.


00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:56.181
We thought we'd saved a witch,
so, we attacked her.


00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.392
But we were wrong.


00:00:59.811 --> 00:01:03.355
She wasn't a witch, she was a princess.


00:01:03.397 --> 00:01:05.732
The Fairy Princess!


00:01:06.067 --> 00:01:08.653
How were we supposed to know?
She looks like a witch,


00:01:08.653 --> 00:01:11.780
and everyone knows that a
princess doesn't look like a witch.


00:01:12.823 --> 00:01:17.369
Anyways, she wanted to teach us a lesson,
so she put a curse on us.


00:01:17.578 --> 00:01:19.538
And this was a nasty one.


00:01:19.705 --> 00:01:24.126
That turned us into little ugly green
monsters whenever people looked at us.


00:01:24.544 --> 00:01:26.421
And the only way to break the curse


00:01:26.463 --> 00:01:30.467
is to get a kiss from the
most beautiful woman in the world.


00:01:31.009 --> 00:01:32.803
Are you kidding me?


00:01:32.886 --> 00:01:34.554
With this face?


00:02:21.814 --> 00:02:23.399
Hello, your majesty.


00:02:23.524 --> 00:02:26.277
- Good morning ma'am.
- Good morning ma'am.


00:02:30.197 --> 00:02:34.161
Magic tree, magic tree...


00:02:34.411 --> 00:02:40.250
Let this morning be the time
that you perform your duty,


00:02:45.548 --> 00:02:53.556
of bringing me the shoes
of youthful eternal... beauty.


00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:02.815
Yes!


00:03:04.108 --> 00:03:05.819
Change me!


00:03:08.196 --> 00:03:09.655
Finally!


00:03:14.578 --> 00:03:16.705
Not again! How long must I wait?


00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:18.541
- No. - Clear these away.


00:03:18.541 --> 00:03:19.542
Uh-oh.


00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:20.125
Heads off.


00:03:20.292 --> 00:03:21.877
Pull yourself together.


00:03:25.673 --> 00:03:26.716
Here you are.


00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:29.677
Oh? Thanks!


00:03:53.119 --> 00:03:56.373
That wasn't here before.
What is she up to now?


00:04:16.186 --> 00:04:17.187
Huh?


00:04:37.917 --> 00:04:38.918
Huh?


00:04:42.755 --> 00:04:44.256
You weren't here before.


00:04:48.886 --> 00:04:49.887
Whatever.


00:04:54.518 --> 00:04:55.852
Oh! Oww!


00:05:00.024 --> 00:05:01.025
Yes!


00:05:04.153 --> 00:05:08.575
I can't believe my beloved daughter
Snow White has turned eighteen.


00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:14.456
I only wish her mother could see the kind of
smart and beautiful young woman she's become.


00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:17.918
Strange thing happened during the party.


00:05:18.126 --> 00:05:21.839
The castle guards brought in
a woman named Regina.


00:05:22.047 --> 00:05:27.845
They said she was a witch,
but she was too beautiful to be a witch.


00:05:27.928 --> 00:05:32.391
I have married Regina.
Everything feels so perfect!


00:05:32.976 --> 00:05:39.399
Except for Regina's strange looking mirror.
There's something not quite right.


00:05:40.024 --> 00:05:44.279
People around the castle have been
disappearing, one by one.


00:05:44.446 --> 00:05:47.074
Is it because of that peculiar mirror?


00:05:47.157 --> 00:05:52.122
I saw it with my own eyes,
Regina talking to a tree.


00:05:52.163 --> 00:05:54.499
She must be a witch!


00:05:54.999 --> 00:05:58.837
I should send Snow away to a safer place.


00:05:58.879 --> 00:06:04.092
My dear Snow, by the time you read this,
my fate will be uncertain.


00:06:04.426 --> 00:06:06.262
She's coming for me now.


00:06:06.387 --> 00:06:11.057
I only hope you can find the
Fearless Seven, and ask them for help.


00:06:12.727 --> 00:06:13.811
Apples...


00:06:13.895 --> 00:06:16.939
...the most suspicious of fruits.


00:06:18.565 --> 00:06:19.567
Oh,


00:06:19.567 --> 00:06:22.653
Papa, where are you?


00:06:26.366 --> 00:06:27.950
But they don't look dangerous.


00:06:45.135 --> 00:06:45.761
Regina?


00:06:45.803 --> 00:06:48.973
No, my shoes! Get her!


00:06:58.317 --> 00:06:59.651
- Can I borrow this?
- Okay.


00:06:59.693 --> 00:07:00.694
Thanks!


00:07:15.125 --> 00:07:16.294
What?


00:07:17.588 --> 00:07:19.965
Nooo!


00:07:27.514 --> 00:07:30.100
Short, chubby, and green.


00:07:31.352 --> 00:07:32.979
Green is like an ogre.


00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:36.232
Blue or yellow could've made us look cute.
And cuddly.


00:07:36.566 --> 00:07:39.111
Quit your complaining, Merlin!


00:07:39.236 --> 00:07:42.948
I'm figuring out how to take this curse
and kick it where the sun don't shine.


00:07:43.156 --> 00:07:47.578
Listen, we need to find the most
beautifullest princess to kiss us,


00:07:47.703 --> 00:07:49.622
and we've just about run out of options.


00:07:50.122 --> 00:07:54.668
How would a beautiful woman
even see you, Mister Invisible?


00:07:57.505 --> 00:07:59.673
- What was that?
- Some kind of bird?


00:08:04.428 --> 00:08:07.347
Magic mirror, full of wisdom,


00:08:07.472 --> 00:08:10.518
who's the fairest in the Kingdom?


00:08:10.852 --> 00:08:13.771
The woman who wears the red shoes.


00:08:15.857 --> 00:08:18.735
And side note, wisdom and
kingdom don't really rhyme.


00:08:18.777 --> 00:08:22.532
Cut the sass and tell me her name!


00:08:23.533 --> 00:08:25.409
How should I know?
I don't get out much.


00:08:25.492 --> 00:08:27.744
Well, you are the magic mirror.


00:08:27.912 --> 00:08:32.417
Magic is just my first name,
it's short for Magichard. Like Richard.


00:08:32.458 --> 00:08:34.877
What can you do then?


00:08:35.044 --> 00:08:39.465
I just reflect what I see,
the truth. The truth is,


00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:44.388
that you should see yourself right now.
Right now!


00:08:45.806 --> 00:08:46.890
Watch it.


00:08:47.516 --> 00:08:52.564
Distribute wanted posters to every town,
village, valley, forth and forge in the kingdom,


00:08:52.689 --> 00:08:54.398
and find her!


00:08:56.192 --> 00:08:57.902
I feel my power draining.


00:08:58.027 --> 00:09:01.864
I don't have much time.
The aging is accelerating.


00:09:02.157 --> 00:09:05.285
And only three bumbling
bits of kindling for help.


00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:09.498
Perhaps you should recruit another, someone
who stands to gain from your success.


00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:11.542
What about this fellow?


00:09:12.375 --> 00:09:14.587
Interesting.


00:09:15.088 --> 00:09:19.217
Tell me more, Magichard.


00:09:20.259 --> 00:09:22.387
Hey hey, Over here! Over here!


00:09:22.429 --> 00:09:23.930
See, see. Come! Very quick.


00:09:23.972 --> 00:09:25.432
Look at this. Look, look, look.


00:09:26.558 --> 00:09:27.559
What is it?


00:09:32.106 --> 00:09:34.274
I know a lot about silhouettes,


00:09:34.483 --> 00:09:36.652
and I think this shape is a witch.


00:09:36.694 --> 00:09:40.114
Let's not jump to conclusions.
Yes, it could be a witch.


00:09:40.197 --> 00:09:41.073
...Or


00:09:41.198 --> 00:09:42.074
Ya. It's a witch


00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:44.160
The witch who cursed us?


00:09:44.244 --> 00:09:46.246
Let's catch her and make
her break the spell!


00:10:05.141 --> 00:10:05.557
En garde!


00:10:05.599 --> 00:10:07.518
Wands where I can see 'em, witch!


00:10:16.527 --> 00:10:17.528
Fraulein!


00:10:17.528 --> 00:10:18.571
No No No! Stop!


00:10:18.613 --> 00:10:20.908
I get you some revenge!


00:10:24.786 --> 00:10:25.871
Beautiful!


00:10:26.205 --> 00:10:29.041
I didn't know anyone could be so beautiful.


00:10:29.124 --> 00:10:30.668
How did she end up with us?


00:10:38.092 --> 00:10:41.888
Hello, dear lady. Welcome to my
home slash command post.


00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:44.558
I have six room mates
but my name's on the lease.


00:10:44.599 --> 00:10:46.017
I pay the rent.


00:10:46.225 --> 00:10:50.605
Your home? Oh my gosh,
I am... I am so sorry.


00:10:50.773 --> 00:10:52.524
I was starving and...


00:10:52.566 --> 00:10:54.568
No need to apologize.


00:10:54.819 --> 00:10:57.447
We didn't mean to interrupt
your stolen meal.


00:10:57.488 --> 00:11:00.658
If you're still hungry,
I can whip up something simple.


00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:02.786
- You see I, marinate the solution and...


00:11:02.828 --> 00:11:03.954
Who is that?


00:11:05.288 --> 00:11:06.289
Uhh...


00:11:06.289 --> 00:11:07.540
Who?


00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:17.510
Wow. I look so different.


00:11:17.844 --> 00:11:20.554
I mean, my face, and my waist,
and my waist and...


00:11:20.596 --> 00:11:21.680
My waist?


00:11:22.306 --> 00:11:25.310
Oh my gosh! What happened to me?


00:11:30.357 --> 00:11:34.861
Oh, I must've gotten up so
quickly my back is killing me.


00:11:35.778 --> 00:11:37.613
You mean your head, right?


00:11:38.155 --> 00:11:41.576
- Do you need help?
- No, I'm fine.


00:11:45.163 --> 00:11:49.376
Is that really what I look like?
In the mirror? Do you see the same thing?


00:11:49.543 --> 00:11:51.211
You're beautiful, miss.


00:11:51.336 --> 00:11:52.922
Like an angel!


00:11:53.089 --> 00:11:54.090
Really?


00:11:55.216 --> 00:11:56.384
Could it be?


00:11:56.592 --> 00:11:58.511
Excuse me, but who are you?


00:11:58.552 --> 00:12:00.054
Oh... I'm Snow...


00:12:00.305 --> 00:12:01.181
Snot?


00:12:01.265 --> 00:12:02.807
No no no no no no.


00:12:04.267 --> 00:12:06.102
My name is...


00:12:06.895 --> 00:12:08.272
R-Red Shoes.


00:12:09.689 --> 00:12:12.567
Yep. It's me. Red Shoes.


00:12:12.609 --> 00:12:17.198
Cool name, but, by any chance
would that be Princess Red Shoes?


00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:18.991
Of course, she's a princess!


00:12:19.033 --> 00:12:21.995
How could she be so beautiful if she weren't?


00:12:22.037 --> 00:12:23.955
Obviously! Right, miss?


00:12:24.039 --> 00:12:27.000
Obviously, I mean I am a princess.


00:12:28.126 --> 00:12:29.503
Who are you guys?


00:12:29.545 --> 00:12:31.630
I'm Merlin.


00:12:31.713 --> 00:12:34.174
Part time hero, full time romantic.


00:12:35.050 --> 00:12:38.304
And this is Jack, Hans, Arthur,
Pino, Noki and Kio.


00:12:38.345 --> 00:12:41.933
No way, your names are
the same as the F-Seven.


00:12:42.058 --> 00:12:44.769
The Fearless Seven.
I'm looking for them.


00:12:44.811 --> 00:12:47.605
Let me guess,
Merlin's your favourite?


00:12:48.481 --> 00:12:50.608
No, not really.


00:12:50.650 --> 00:12:52.820
No, that Merlin's not your type.


00:12:52.903 --> 00:12:55.823
You seem like a Prince Arthur fan to me.


00:12:55.948 --> 00:12:59.493
Honestly, none of them are
really my type.


00:13:01.245 --> 00:13:02.246
Oh.


00:13:02.246 --> 00:13:04.165
Well. That's fine.


00:13:04.332 --> 00:13:07.586
Because we're not them, we're
actually completely different people.


00:13:07.627 --> 00:13:12.381
In no way are we the same guys, put under
a curse, and changed into different forms.


00:13:12.423 --> 00:13:15.593
But only if someone looks at us,
It's very complicated.


00:13:15.634 --> 00:13:16.635
Right. We're all clear.


00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:20.390
So how can I assist you, my fair lady?


00:13:20.682 --> 00:13:22.392
I need to find my father,


00:13:22.517 --> 00:13:24.394
and I know that the F-Seven can help.


00:13:25.061 --> 00:13:29.399
We know the F-Seven very well,
and their schedule is fully booked.


00:13:29.566 --> 00:13:32.402
Leave it to me,
I'll find your father within the month.


00:13:32.444 --> 00:13:34.029
I can do it in one week.


00:13:34.071 --> 00:13:35.781
- Four days! - Three days!


00:13:35.823 --> 00:13:37.116
- Two days! - One!


00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:38.075
Oomph!


00:13:38.117 --> 00:13:40.327
I already found your
father like, two weeks ago.


00:13:40.411 --> 00:13:41.496
Really?


00:13:41.579 --> 00:13:44.540
I just need a few days
to get him across state lines.


00:13:44.582 --> 00:13:46.584
I seriously need to find my dad.


00:13:46.626 --> 00:13:51.047
Hold on. Nobody has seen the F-Seven
in over a year, right?


00:13:51.173 --> 00:13:54.510
You're not going to find them now,
we're your best bet.


00:13:55.886 --> 00:13:59.265
Wow. No-ones offered to
help me for such a long time.


00:14:00.266 --> 00:14:01.392
You guys are awesome


00:14:01.433 --> 00:14:04.771
Really? You think we are awesome?


00:14:04.812 --> 00:14:10.109
Yeah, you guys are caring, and sweet, and...


00:14:10.151 --> 00:14:12.988
And not completely hideous to look at?


00:14:13.155 --> 00:14:16.366
No, you guys are totally adorable.


00:14:16.408 --> 00:14:18.286
I think I hit her too hard.


00:14:18.327 --> 00:14:21.205
But she is beautiful.


00:14:22.373 --> 00:14:24.833
She can help me break the curse.


00:14:29.839 --> 00:14:33.093
Who is coming to my birthday party?


00:14:33.177 --> 00:14:35.054
Has Ariel RSVP'd?


00:14:35.095 --> 00:14:37.764
She says she can't make it, sir.
She has to wax her legs.


00:14:37.806 --> 00:14:39.099
But she's a mermaid!


00:14:39.183 --> 00:14:40.310
What about Sleeping Beauty?


00:14:40.351 --> 00:14:41.561
Doctor's appointment.


00:14:41.602 --> 00:14:43.729
- Is she sick?
- Says she has insomnia.


00:14:43.771 --> 00:14:46.023
If she's not gonna sleep,
she can come to our party.


00:14:46.065 --> 00:14:47.067
What about Rapunzel?


00:14:47.108 --> 00:14:50.236
And don't tell me she's
getting her hair done.


00:14:50.278 --> 00:14:53.489
Nope. It's something called, uh, book.


00:14:53.573 --> 00:14:54.533
Princess Cruise?


00:14:54.575 --> 00:14:55.701
That's a ship, sir.


00:14:55.742 --> 00:14:56.410
Princess Leia?


00:14:56.452 --> 00:14:57.618
She's a general!


00:14:57.618 --> 00:15:00.370
I demand glorious guests!


00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:03.834
How can I be any more unpopular!


00:15:03.875 --> 00:15:06.544
And I don't understand, why?


00:15:09.048 --> 00:15:11.842
Greetings, Prince Average.


00:15:11.883 --> 00:15:14.428
It's pronounced Avv-vous-rarge.


00:15:14.553 --> 00:15:15.929
Sure it is.


00:15:16.222 --> 00:15:19.809
If you're here for the 'We Love
Our Peasants' group giveaway,


00:15:19.851 --> 00:15:22.728
that motion is ended.
Grab your wrinkles and go.


00:15:22.895 --> 00:15:23.896
Move along.


00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:31.739
Do you think that people would respect you,


00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:38.662
if you celebrated your birthday with
a beautiful woman on your arm?


00:15:38.955 --> 00:15:42.125
Finally, someone talking sense!


00:15:42.166 --> 00:15:44.001
This horrible crone gets it!


00:15:44.042 --> 00:15:46.713
May I suggest inviting


00:15:47.088 --> 00:15:49.298
this young lady?


00:15:50.383 --> 00:15:53.137
She's beautiful, when can she get here?


00:15:53.178 --> 00:15:55.014
Well, that's up to you.


00:15:55.139 --> 00:15:58.725
You see, she's stolen something from me.


00:15:58.933 --> 00:16:04.815
You find her, bring her along with you,
and you won't look like such a loser,


00:16:04.982 --> 00:16:08.111
and I get my shoes back.


00:16:08.278 --> 00:16:10.280
Fear not, loyal hag.


00:16:10.321 --> 00:16:12.448
I, Prince Average,


00:16:12.573 --> 00:16:16.453
shall find this fugitive,
and make her pay for her crimes,


00:16:16.578 --> 00:16:18.622
by making her attend my birthday party.


00:16:19.748 --> 00:16:22.168
There shall be balloons!


00:16:22.251 --> 00:16:25.629
I just thought of it.
Let's have a lot of balloons!


00:16:25.963 --> 00:16:27.839
What a buffoon.


00:16:36.433 --> 00:16:38.393
It looks just like papa.


00:16:44.232 --> 00:16:45.817
Papa won't recognise me.


00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:56.161
Why won't... why won't these
shoes just come off?


00:17:02.793 --> 00:17:05.505
Yes, this is me.


00:17:13.806 --> 00:17:17.476
Would you like to join me
in a moisturising mask?


00:17:17.642 --> 00:17:20.605
Oh, thanks, oh. But I am...


00:17:21.522 --> 00:17:22.523
Oh!


00:17:22.523 --> 00:17:23.566
So tired.


00:17:23.608 --> 00:17:24.900
Are you sure?


00:17:25.067 --> 00:17:27.863
It's very important to take
care of your skin.


00:17:27.904 --> 00:17:28.905
Positive.


00:17:31.032 --> 00:17:34.411
But this is the finest French
recipe meant to hydrate skin.


00:17:34.828 --> 00:17:37.122
It is made of French poopee!


00:17:38.457 --> 00:17:39.458
Papa?


00:17:40.626 --> 00:17:44.964
Hmm. A spell that makes you fall in love.


00:17:45.256 --> 00:17:46.715
Oh, there it is.


00:17:47.049 --> 00:17:49.344
Merlin! Have you seen my cook book?


00:17:49.386 --> 00:17:51.596
Have you checked in the kitchen?


00:17:51.763 --> 00:17:55.141
Ah, silly me! The kitchen. Of course!


00:17:57.645 --> 00:17:59.562
Now, where was I?


00:18:00.355 --> 00:18:02.607
Merlin, have you seen my moisturizer?


00:18:04.193 --> 00:18:05.569
- It's nowhere to be... - No!


00:18:05.611 --> 00:18:08.781
Whatever it is, I haven't seen it.
Now please, go away.


00:18:08.822 --> 00:18:10.909
Someone's got anger management issues.


00:18:14.996 --> 00:18:17.582
Getting a kiss was never
a problem with this face.


00:18:20.419 --> 00:18:21.420
Red Shoes?


00:18:23.462 --> 00:18:24.798
Papa?


00:18:25.465 --> 00:18:27.216
Papa? Are you there?


00:18:28.134 --> 00:18:29.177
Papa?


00:18:52.118 --> 00:18:56.415
Boys! I'm telling you. Sweet treats are
the way to a woman's heart.


00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:01.921
It works! I call it, an auto portrait.


00:19:01.963 --> 00:19:03.589
I call it, the duplicatertron.


00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:05.091
I call it, selfie!


00:19:05.132 --> 00:19:06.800
Red Shoes must love it!


00:19:06.842 --> 00:19:08.303
Monsieur, monsieur.


00:19:08.345 --> 00:19:11.013
She doesn't want sweets and selfies.


00:19:11.181 --> 00:19:13.516
Women want diamonds.


00:19:13.766 --> 00:19:14.767
Merlin?


00:19:21.024 --> 00:19:24.820
The Book of Spells To Make You Fall In Love?


00:19:28.949 --> 00:19:32.621
Okay, big, terrifying, wooden bunny.


00:19:32.662 --> 00:19:34.122
You're a nice bunny.


00:19:34.914 --> 00:19:37.125
You're a Vegan bunny, right?


00:19:40.712 --> 00:19:43.089
What was that? Lightning?


00:19:43.215 --> 00:19:45.718
Actually, it's called magic. I do it.


00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:48.012
Really? Then do some!


00:19:49.054 --> 00:19:50.765
♪ Darling...


00:19:52.183 --> 00:19:55.811
♪ Wish you could see what can I see


00:19:56.354 --> 00:20:00.108
♪ Miles ahead just you and me


00:20:00.484 --> 00:20:03.487
♪ To infinity


00:20:08.741 --> 00:20:11.577
Keep running, and whatever
you do, don't look back.


00:20:11.619 --> 00:20:12.912
But I can't leave without you.


00:20:13.163 --> 00:20:15.416
You're looking back. Don't do that.


00:20:15.624 --> 00:20:16.625
But...


00:20:17.376 --> 00:20:19.252
Hate to zap you longears,


00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:21.923
But I need to impress a beautiful woman.


00:20:22.089 --> 00:20:24.258
Big, scary bunny! Over here!


00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:26.302
Red! Stop putting yourself in...


00:20:28.513 --> 00:20:30.182
...danger...


00:20:49.953 --> 00:20:51.663
Arthur! I got you.


00:20:51.913 --> 00:20:54.373
It's no use, Red Shoes.


00:20:54.415 --> 00:20:58.087
I'm slippin' away. Not much time...


00:20:58.128 --> 00:21:01.256
Just... need to... use that core of mine...


00:21:01.298 --> 00:21:03.800
I see the light at the end of the funnel.


00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:07.513
Time for me to kick the bucket


00:21:07.555 --> 00:21:09.556
I had a good run. I was God blessed.


00:21:09.598 --> 00:21:13.603
Oh, I used to be able to bench two fifty!


00:21:13.811 --> 00:21:16.981
Before I go, how about a farewell kiss?


00:21:17.022 --> 00:21:20.068
Red Shoes! Thank goodness you're safe.


00:21:20.319 --> 00:21:23.029
Do you need CPR? I'm basically an expert.


00:21:23.071 --> 00:21:25.323
And don't worry, I brushed my teeth.


00:21:25.365 --> 00:21:27.618
No, No, No. I'm fine, but Arthur, he's stuck.


00:21:27.659 --> 00:21:29.120
He tried to save me and...


00:21:29.161 --> 00:21:30.621
Would you get up?


00:21:31.038 --> 00:21:32.664
What? He's not hurt?


00:21:32.831 --> 00:21:35.252
- Only his pride.
- Seriously Arthur?


00:21:35.377 --> 00:21:37.795
You need to find a better
way to hit on girls.


00:21:47.139 --> 00:21:50.016
Stand back! I may have to risk my life.


00:21:59.317 --> 00:22:01.194
Someone call for three inventors?


00:22:01.361 --> 00:22:02.821
For three geniuses?


00:22:03.406 --> 00:22:04.907
That sounds like us!


00:22:06.158 --> 00:22:09.620
Everyone came runnin' to help,
great, just great.


00:22:09.662 --> 00:22:11.372
Everyone except Merlin, that is.


00:22:11.414 --> 00:22:13.624
Ah! Super, there he is now.


00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:15.126
Where have you been?


00:22:15.168 --> 00:22:17.922
Something awful could've happened
to Red if I hadn't shown up.


00:22:17.963 --> 00:22:19.048
You?


00:22:19.798 --> 00:22:22.008
Don't even go there!


00:22:22.384 --> 00:22:24.554
I saved her first.


00:22:25.680 --> 00:22:27.598
- Right?
- I was worried about you.


00:22:27.723 --> 00:22:29.642
I was worried about me too.


00:22:29.975 --> 00:22:32.812
- But mostly you.
- No-one needs to worry.


00:22:32.854 --> 00:22:35.106
Arthur's here. Please, my lady.


00:22:35.231 --> 00:22:36.524
Um... Okay.


00:22:45.784 --> 00:22:47.870
You shouldn't go into the
forest by yourself.


00:22:48.079 --> 00:22:53.125
It's a nightmarish landsacpe, fit only for
bloodthirsty warriors like myself.


00:22:53.543 --> 00:22:54.669
...And squirrels.


00:22:54.836 --> 00:22:56.546
I thought I saw my father.


00:22:57.213 --> 00:22:59.966
Turned out, just to be that big bunny.


00:23:00.132 --> 00:23:04.137
Well, if you ever make such a dangerous
and weird mistake again,


00:23:04.304 --> 00:23:06.473
just know that I can protect you.


00:23:06.973 --> 00:23:08.267
This's very kind.


00:23:08.309 --> 00:23:12.938
And if you really want to express
your gratitude, you can...


00:23:14.732 --> 00:23:17.193
Oh, I am so sorry.


00:23:17.235 --> 00:23:22.532
This was much slappier than
I intended it to be.


00:23:22.907 --> 00:23:25.327
Oh! It happens. No problem.


00:23:26.035 --> 00:23:28.287
Maybe an apology kiss then?


00:23:30.916 --> 00:23:32.334
Bravo mon ami!


00:23:32.835 --> 00:23:34.210
Nice try.


00:23:34.878 --> 00:23:36.420
Red Shoes.


00:23:41.176 --> 00:23:44.639
Gentlemen, to break this curse, we're going
to have to work as a tightly knit team.


00:23:44.764 --> 00:23:46.682
Which means, you do everything I say.


00:23:46.766 --> 00:23:48.308
- Excuse? - Huh? - What? - No.


00:23:48.350 --> 00:23:49.101
You got to be kidding.


00:23:49.143 --> 00:23:51.396
Hans and Jack will search around the Dismal Lake.


00:23:51.479 --> 00:23:54.357
Triplets! You search the Caves Of Despair.


00:23:54.482 --> 00:23:57.527
Red Shoe and I, will go to Golden Goose Avenue.


00:23:57.652 --> 00:24:02.323
Golden Goose Avenue, which happens
to be your go to place for dates.


00:24:02.448 --> 00:24:04.660
We are going to focus on the mission.


00:24:04.826 --> 00:24:07.121
And then see where the evening takes us.


00:24:07.413 --> 00:24:11.583
The only thing you're going to shop for
on Golden Goose Avenue, is rejection.


00:24:11.625 --> 00:24:13.295
And you can't even afford that.


00:24:13.461 --> 00:24:16.047
I like my odds. You saw what she did.


00:24:16.088 --> 00:24:18.424
An expression of affection.


00:24:18.591 --> 00:24:20.427
Every woman shows it differently.


00:24:20.552 --> 00:24:22.054
You took your shot. You got slapped.


00:24:22.095 --> 00:24:23.138
May I remind you


00:24:23.180 --> 00:24:27.059
that this is the closest thing to a
kiss anyone's had since the curse.


00:24:28.144 --> 00:24:31.730
Let's work together to guide
Red Shoes' feelings towards me


00:24:31.772 --> 00:24:33.607
so we can break the curse.


00:24:33.649 --> 00:24:34.943
What about the rest of us?


00:24:34.984 --> 00:24:37.486
After I resume my princely form,


00:24:37.653 --> 00:24:40.114
the word about F-Seven will be out.


00:24:40.156 --> 00:24:43.910
Ladies will be begging to kiss your green mugs.


00:24:43.993 --> 00:24:45.787
- Really?
- Sounds reasonable.


00:24:45.870 --> 00:24:47.372
I'll bring the gelato!


00:24:47.414 --> 00:24:50.000
Getting one kiss sure is easier
than getting seven.


00:24:50.084 --> 00:24:52.962
This is not a plan,
he's just out for himself!


00:24:53.003 --> 00:24:55.005
A half baked plan is better than none.


00:24:55.047 --> 00:24:58.634
Don't worry Merlin,
I have a big assignment for you.


00:24:59.302 --> 00:25:00.886
Big assignment?


00:25:01.221 --> 00:25:03.389
Here you go. I drew these up last night.


00:25:03.764 --> 00:25:07.143
I can't tell if this drawing is terrible, or


00:25:07.769 --> 00:25:09.479
really avant garde.


00:25:09.604 --> 00:25:11.815
Oh, my neighbor's a great art teacher.


00:25:11.983 --> 00:25:13.359
Pablo Picassover?


00:25:13.400 --> 00:25:17.195
One thing's for sure,
daddy's on the big side...


00:25:17.778 --> 00:25:19.365
...of big.


00:25:20.532 --> 00:25:21.950
You must take after your mother.


00:25:22.158 --> 00:25:23.409
No, I look a lot like papa... Oh!


00:25:24.410 --> 00:25:30.667
Yeah, my mother. Gosh! We... exactly! Twins!


00:25:31.502 --> 00:25:34.339
Alright. You know the plan. Let's move.


00:25:34.381 --> 00:25:37.174
Deploy! Thunderdwarfs are go!


00:25:39.636 --> 00:25:41.138
And where d'ya think you're going?


00:25:41.471 --> 00:25:43.181
Your post is right there.


00:25:43.265 --> 00:25:45.850
You'll watch the savage monster.
I call him Vicious!


00:25:45.892 --> 00:25:47.435
I call him Woodbottom.


00:25:47.520 --> 00:25:49.938
Do not worry Merlin. We'll make
sure you get kissed too.


00:25:50.188 --> 00:25:51.399
Eventually.


00:25:52.983 --> 00:25:54.192
We'll split up here.


00:25:54.234 --> 00:25:55.987
Alright, see you later.


00:25:56.863 --> 00:25:59.823
I know exactly where we should
look to find your father.


00:26:00.074 --> 00:26:01.575
Really? Where?


00:26:09.627 --> 00:26:10.753
Daddy!


00:26:11.045 --> 00:26:12.046
Wow!


00:26:13.047 --> 00:26:14.214
Is this what I think it is?


00:26:14.256 --> 00:26:20.305
I present Excalibur, the legendary
sword trapped in this rock for centuries.


00:26:20.680 --> 00:26:24.059
Waiting for a man of great
strength to release it.


00:26:24.100 --> 00:26:27.353
It says 'Do not attempt to remove by force'.


00:26:27.437 --> 00:26:29.940
...Oh, right. I guess. Ahem.


00:26:30.273 --> 00:26:36.363
The truth is, I realized you were the woman
of my destiny the first time I saw you.


00:26:36.697 --> 00:26:39.409
I thought if I could show you my strength


00:26:39.659 --> 00:26:41.869
I would be worthy of your affections.


00:26:45.791 --> 00:26:46.791
Oh!


00:26:47.292 --> 00:26:49.252
Oops, I'll put it back.


00:26:49.294 --> 00:26:50.962
No No No! Can I have it?


00:27:01.348 --> 00:27:04.517
Oh, Arthur, it's just beginner's luck.


00:27:04.851 --> 00:27:07.104
You want me to, maybe pull
it out for you again?


00:27:07.354 --> 00:27:09.607
No, I'm not humiliated at all.


00:27:10.399 --> 00:27:11.442
Let's go.


00:27:21.035 --> 00:27:24.789
Don't look at me like that,
I'm the real prisoner here.


00:27:25.039 --> 00:27:27.125
What? You hungry?


00:27:28.585 --> 00:27:30.170
And fetch!


00:27:38.138 --> 00:27:39.889
Hop along, big guy!


00:27:40.097 --> 00:27:42.850
There's no way Arthur is
breaking this curse alone!


00:27:59.827 --> 00:28:00.912
Woah!


00:28:02.664 --> 00:28:04.456
Arthur, where're you going?


00:28:07.710 --> 00:28:08.711
Okay.


00:28:09.296 --> 00:28:10.422
See you later.


00:28:11.589 --> 00:28:12.590
Hi.


00:28:13.509 --> 00:28:15.428
Oh, look at what you made me do!


00:28:15.511 --> 00:28:16.554
You...


00:28:16.762 --> 00:28:17.971
I'm sorry.


00:28:18.180 --> 00:28:20.183
...made me make it perfect.


00:28:20.641 --> 00:28:21.642
Thank you.


00:28:22.143 --> 00:28:23.144
Woah!


00:28:24.228 --> 00:28:26.021
I'm so sorry.


00:28:26.064 --> 00:28:28.983
No, don't be. I am sorry.


00:28:29.318 --> 00:28:30.652
Are you alright?


00:28:30.777 --> 00:28:31.778
And...


00:28:31.778 --> 00:28:33.572
...don't worry about this.


00:28:36.826 --> 00:28:37.492
What?


00:28:37.701 --> 00:28:39.078
Ta-da!


00:28:41.496 --> 00:28:43.790
Excuse me, have you seen this man?


00:28:43.832 --> 00:28:46.335
♪ I'm feeling good today


00:28:47.085 --> 00:28:50.339
♪ And nothing standing in my way


00:28:50.505 --> 00:28:52.674
♪ I wouldn't change a thing


00:28:52.967 --> 00:28:56.554
♪ I must have been walking in a dream


00:28:56.846 --> 00:28:59.765
♪ Everybody wants to stop and stare


00:29:00.057 --> 00:29:03.102
♪ People talk but I don't care


00:29:03.268 --> 00:29:06.439
♪ Everybody wants to stop and stare


00:29:06.522 --> 00:29:09.525
♪ People talk but I don't care


00:29:09.650 --> 00:29:12.654
♪ Don't matter what you think or see


00:29:12.654 --> 00:29:15.157
♪ There's no-one I would rather be


00:29:15.574 --> 00:29:18.620
♪ Take me as I am this is me


00:29:18.786 --> 00:29:21.998
♪ There's no-one I would rather be


00:29:22.498 --> 00:29:23.791
♪ It don't matter


00:29:24.500 --> 00:29:26.920
♪ It don't matter to me


00:29:27.712 --> 00:29:29.506
♪ It don't matter


00:29:30.090 --> 00:29:33.135
♪ Take me as I am this is me


00:29:46.357 --> 00:29:49.152
Arthur, I was thinking.


00:29:49.193 --> 00:29:51.905
What if I just pull out the Excalibur for you?


00:29:51.946 --> 00:29:53.447
Our secret.


00:29:54.198 --> 00:29:56.368
Really? We have a secret now?


00:29:56.410 --> 00:29:56.994
Yeah.


00:29:57.036 --> 00:29:59.663
I like a girl who can keep things classified.


00:29:59.663 --> 00:30:01.957
Let's find your pops, friend.


00:30:02.167 --> 00:30:03.168
'Bye guys.


00:30:07.254 --> 00:30:08.255
What?


00:30:09.633 --> 00:30:11.592
Hey, you.


00:30:11.968 --> 00:30:13.094
No.


00:30:14.304 --> 00:30:15.305
Hey!


00:30:15.931 --> 00:30:16.932
Stop!


00:30:22.854 --> 00:30:23.856
Come on!


00:30:51.218 --> 00:30:53.429
Oh, you guys don't have to help.


00:30:53.554 --> 00:30:55.639
That's not her. Come on.


00:30:55.681 --> 00:30:56.682
Sorry miss.


00:31:00.478 --> 00:31:03.147
Red Shoes! Where has she gone?


00:31:03.189 --> 00:31:04.940
Where's Red Shoes?


00:31:04.982 --> 00:31:06.650
That's what I'd like to know.


00:31:07.152 --> 00:31:08.445
Wait a minute.


00:31:08.570 --> 00:31:10.113
Who said you could leave your post?


00:31:10.154 --> 00:31:12.198
I'm just walking the bunny.


00:31:14.660 --> 00:31:17.037
Red Shoes, where are you?


00:31:17.204 --> 00:31:19.414
Hey, have you seen this girl?


00:31:25.087 --> 00:31:26.296
Look what I found


00:31:26.338 --> 00:31:29.635
Oh, those're mine.
Can I, actually have my shoes back?


00:31:32.470 --> 00:31:34.764
No way. You're not serious, are you?


00:31:34.805 --> 00:31:38.560
I'm really not in the mood,
Can you just, please give them back to me?


00:31:39.395 --> 00:31:41.062
Ha! They won't even fit on you.


00:31:41.104 --> 00:31:43.190
They're gonna fit me better
than they fit you.


00:31:43.232 --> 00:31:44.233
Hey!


00:31:45.234 --> 00:31:46.318
Red Shoes!


00:31:46.443 --> 00:31:48.237
Guys! Guys, I'm here.


00:31:51.824 --> 00:31:54.911
- Red Shoes!
- Red Shoes! Where are you?


00:31:56.203 --> 00:31:58.832
Even the hideous dwarfs won't help you.


00:32:01.376 --> 00:32:04.129
Those dwarfs are not hideous.


00:32:04.254 --> 00:32:06.882
And I don't need anyone to help me.


00:32:08.884 --> 00:32:10.760
Freeze! Put the shoes down.


00:32:10.802 --> 00:32:13.347
Get on your knees and put
your hands behind your head.


00:32:13.389 --> 00:32:15.182
On second thought, they're yours.


00:32:15.223 --> 00:32:18.351
There's no need to push me in a corner


00:32:18.560 --> 00:32:20.438
Super scary.


00:32:31.074 --> 00:32:32.867
Your red shoes, milady.


00:32:33.660 --> 00:32:34.662
Thank you.


00:32:34.870 --> 00:32:37.539
Excuse me, miss, have we met?


00:32:38.916 --> 00:32:41.377
Well, that's kind of a complicated question.


00:32:41.502 --> 00:32:42.878
Red Shoes!


00:32:43.504 --> 00:32:46.048
Gotta go. Be safe.


00:33:06.278 --> 00:33:07.279
Guys!


00:33:09.823 --> 00:33:11.409
Where has she gone?


00:33:12.577 --> 00:33:13.828
Red Shoes!


00:33:14.246 --> 00:33:15.247
Stop!


00:33:18.125 --> 00:33:19.126
Hold on!


00:33:22.713 --> 00:33:23.713
Wait a minute.


00:33:24.883 --> 00:33:27.051
Gotcha now, don't we?


00:33:27.968 --> 00:33:28.969
I don't get it.


00:33:32.557 --> 00:33:35.101
Now we know how fast a
bunny can hop in a pinch.


00:33:35.351 --> 00:33:36.895
Thank you for helping me, Merlin.


00:33:37.061 --> 00:33:38.479
A pleasure, milady.


00:33:38.897 --> 00:33:40.983
But I also did it for us.


00:33:41.816 --> 00:33:44.403
By the way, what is this?


00:33:45.529 --> 00:33:47.490
Gosh, it seems silly but...


00:33:48.157 --> 00:33:49.617
...It's my shoes


00:33:50.576 --> 00:33:53.036
- They're magical.
- I know, they're fabulous.


00:33:53.161 --> 00:33:54.621
But why're they after you?


00:33:54.663 --> 00:33:58.959
No, my shoes, they're actually made of magic.


00:33:59.001 --> 00:34:00.335
Red Shoes!


00:34:00.627 --> 00:34:01.671
Are you a criminal?


00:34:02.004 --> 00:34:03.798
No, of course not.


00:34:04.424 --> 00:34:07.635
I knew a girl this pretty couldn't
possibly be a criminal.


00:34:07.843 --> 00:34:11.181
Look, we should head out now,
there could be more guards around any minute.


00:34:11.431 --> 00:34:14.309
Don't worry about them,
I've got these bad boys.


00:34:14.684 --> 00:34:17.604
This is gonna make it so much
harder to find my dad.


00:34:21.567 --> 00:34:22.609
I have an idea!


00:34:25.279 --> 00:34:29.700
♪ What a sight what I feel
when I'm looking at you


00:34:29.825 --> 00:34:33.663
♪ Like I see in the sky for
the very first time


00:34:33.705 --> 00:34:40.838
♪ And I want you to know that I've
never seen something so beautiful


00:34:42.214 --> 00:34:46.885
♪ In the stars it's a sign that
our worlds could collide


00:34:47.470 --> 00:34:50.681
♪ You and I, side by side


00:34:50.806 --> 00:34:57.814
♪ And I want you to know that I've
never seen something so beautiful


00:34:58.356 --> 00:34:59.566
Ta-da!


00:35:00.317 --> 00:35:02.444
Oh wow!


00:35:06.991 --> 00:35:07.992
What do you think?


00:35:08.451 --> 00:35:11.161
That is amazing.


00:35:12.705 --> 00:35:13.497
Thank you.


00:35:13.580 --> 00:35:18.294
♪ This is the start of something so right


00:35:18.503 --> 00:35:23.300
♪ Suddenly all of the stars have aligned


00:35:23.675 --> 00:35:27.178
♪ In the right place at the right time


00:35:30.516 --> 00:35:33.519
You had a thing on your cheek.


00:35:33.560 --> 00:35:34.645
Alright, let's go.


00:35:54.457 --> 00:35:57.878
- We've been walking for hours.
- And we'll keep walking 'till we find them.


00:36:04.677 --> 00:36:06.429
Now we got her.


00:36:07.930 --> 00:36:10.308
- Are they gone?
- Shh. Who cares? -


00:36:10.516 --> 00:36:12.018
C'mon. Let's go see.


00:36:12.977 --> 00:36:14.062
Look at that.


00:36:15.063 --> 00:36:16.064
- Wow!
- Wow!


00:36:16.064 --> 00:36:17.106
Awsome!


00:36:17.231 --> 00:36:18.149
Who's that?


00:36:18.191 --> 00:36:19.568
It's the girl's father.


00:36:19.734 --> 00:36:21.028
But where's the girl?


00:36:21.195 --> 00:36:24.198
It says to go to Risky Rock,
so she must be there.


00:36:24.698 --> 00:36:26.074
Why Risky Rock?


00:36:26.200 --> 00:36:27.410
We should ask the girl.


00:36:27.452 --> 00:36:29.829
Perfect! Where's the girl?


00:36:30.079 --> 00:36:33.415
It says to go to Risky Rock,
so she must be there.


00:36:33.709 --> 00:36:36.002
But, why Risky Rock?


00:36:36.169 --> 00:36:37.545
We should ask the girl.


00:36:37.420 --> 00:36:38.421
Umm...


00:36:38.421 --> 00:36:39.589
Where's the girl?


00:36:39.630 --> 00:36:42.218
It says to go to Risky Rock,
so she must be there.


00:36:42.259 --> 00:36:44.511
But, why Risky Rock?


00:36:44.720 --> 00:36:45.929
We should ask the girl.


00:36:57.275 --> 00:37:01.863
♪ This is the start of something so right


00:37:01.863 --> 00:37:05.868
♪ Suddenly all of the stars have aligned


00:37:05.951 --> 00:37:06.744
Oww!


00:37:07.369 --> 00:37:08.495
What was that for?


00:37:08.536 --> 00:37:11.540
You, sir, are sabotaging my
relationship with Red Shoes.


00:37:11.582 --> 00:37:13.834
What relationship are
you talking about?


00:37:13.876 --> 00:37:16.420
Red Shoes and I share a secret.


00:37:16.462 --> 00:37:19.422
I would tell you what it is,
but it's a secret.


00:37:19.548 --> 00:37:22.968
While you're busy keeping secrets,
I'm going to break my curse.


00:37:23.051 --> 00:37:25.263
You're nothing without
your spells, magic boy.


00:37:25.304 --> 00:37:27.806
And you're nothing without Excalibur.


00:37:28.557 --> 00:37:32.396
You're not waiting for someone to
pull it out for you, are you?


00:37:32.437 --> 00:37:33.480
How did you know?


00:37:33.605 --> 00:37:34.689
Is it true?


00:37:49.789 --> 00:37:51.373
Hans, you shouldn't have.


00:37:51.498 --> 00:37:54.335
Something sweet, for someone sweeter.


00:37:56.587 --> 00:37:57.922
This is spectacular!


00:37:57.964 --> 00:38:00.676
Oh, it's nothing.
Just let me know what you want.


00:38:00.676 --> 00:38:04.012
Any time, for the rest of your life.
Do you like fondue?


00:38:04.054 --> 00:38:09.268
Behold! Carved by the finest jewellers
out of all the jewellers I know


00:38:09.560 --> 00:38:10.812
which is a lot.


00:38:12.188 --> 00:38:12.646
Pretty.


00:38:12.688 --> 00:38:17.277
And it's yours, Miss Shoes,
yours in exchange for nothing.


00:38:17.360 --> 00:38:18.278
Make it a kiss.


00:38:18.361 --> 00:38:21.405
That's really sweet Jack,
but I can't accept it.


00:38:21.656 --> 00:38:24.451
I don't want your jewells,
only your good intentions.


00:38:24.492 --> 00:38:27.913
My intentions are more than good,
they're super bonne.


00:38:27.996 --> 00:38:29.081
Testing one, two.


00:38:29.164 --> 00:38:31.917
Testing one... no, I'm pushing it, you dolt.


00:38:31.959 --> 00:38:34.127
Attention! Hideous trolls!


00:38:34.169 --> 00:38:37.340
Is it dwarfs with an 'f',
or dwarves, with a 'v'?


00:38:37.381 --> 00:38:38.925
I want to use whatever's more offensive.


00:38:38.967 --> 00:38:41.010
Oh, it's that loser, Prince Average.


00:38:41.094 --> 00:38:43.262
I heard that! It's Avv-vous-rarge!


00:38:43.304 --> 00:38:44.223
Oh, please.


00:38:44.264 --> 00:38:49.644
Inside your amateurs attempt at a facade
of a sham of a travesty of a veneer of a castle


00:38:49.686 --> 00:38:52.815
is a gorgeous wanted criminal.


00:38:52.898 --> 00:38:57.444
I hereby command that all of you exit
the premises and surrender post haste.


00:38:57.569 --> 00:39:01.532
Fail to comply, and you will
never see these two again.


00:39:01.782 --> 00:39:03.408
You have until three.


00:39:03.700 --> 00:39:04.701
One.


00:39:06.912 --> 00:39:07.705
Two.


00:39:07.872 --> 00:39:09.248
I lied. Charge!


00:39:29.896 --> 00:39:31.272
Am I the person you want?


00:39:31.313 --> 00:39:33.149
Yes, yes you are.


00:39:33.357 --> 00:39:36.903
Though I don't know if you're a person
or a vision of beauty, some kind of angelic


00:39:37.237 --> 00:39:40.907
thing with wings. Angelic wing things?


00:39:41.282 --> 00:39:44.745
I will come with you,
but only after you release my friends.


00:39:44.953 --> 00:39:45.954
Do it. Do it!


00:39:47.998 --> 00:39:50.709
Now, here's the good news.
It's my birthday!


00:39:50.876 --> 00:39:54.338
And you are going to be
the belle of the ball.


00:39:54.380 --> 00:39:58.134
The invitation sounds great,
really. But...


00:39:58.217 --> 00:40:00.469
It wasn't an invitation,
more of an order.


00:40:00.594 --> 00:40:01.554
Prepare the lady's carriage.


00:40:01.595 --> 00:40:04.141
She said she doesn't want to go, Average.


00:40:04.183 --> 00:40:07.102
Avv-vous-rarge!


00:40:07.227 --> 00:40:08.853
Don't troll me, Troll.


00:40:09.229 --> 00:40:10.355
Ah! So rude.


00:40:10.397 --> 00:40:12.650
I couldn't agree more.
Subjects these days.


00:40:12.692 --> 00:40:13.818
Now. Shall we?


00:40:22.410 --> 00:40:23.411
Get her!


00:40:23.661 --> 00:40:25.330
You hold off the guards, and
I'll get her out of here.


00:40:25.371 --> 00:40:28.417
No, I'm faster. You stay
here and buy us time.


00:40:36.758 --> 00:40:37.551
Here's a thought.


00:40:37.759 --> 00:40:39.928
Stop fighting and fight!


00:40:41.473 --> 00:40:42.515
What's the plan?


00:40:43.558 --> 00:40:45.017
Rescue Red Shoes.


00:40:45.059 --> 00:40:46.977
Like the old days, guys.


00:41:21.973 --> 00:41:22.974
Arthur!


00:41:28.980 --> 00:41:31.150
Can we get this over with?
They're just dwarfs!


00:41:43.454 --> 00:41:45.916
Did you guys hear something?


00:41:54.967 --> 00:41:55.968
Come on!


00:42:16.365 --> 00:42:17.366
Duck!


00:42:23.539 --> 00:42:25.834
Hi, guards, are we taking a break?


00:42:25.917 --> 00:42:27.043
...well, FYI


00:42:27.085 --> 00:42:29.337
They're getting away!


00:42:36.218 --> 00:42:37.345
No!


00:42:43.351 --> 00:42:45.687
Who's throwin' vegetables?


00:42:50.233 --> 00:42:53.112
Yeah! You just got Merlined!


00:43:01.287 --> 00:43:02.288
Run!


00:43:03.706 --> 00:43:04.707
Jack!


00:43:15.427 --> 00:43:16.428
Duck!


00:43:21.351 --> 00:43:23.102
I'm so sorry. You alright?


00:43:23.227 --> 00:43:25.479
No. I'm not.


00:43:31.194 --> 00:43:34.197
Gentlemen, he surrenders.


00:43:34.406 --> 00:43:35.408
What?


00:44:05.440 --> 00:44:06.857
Engines. Full power.


00:44:06.941 --> 00:44:07.942
Shields up.


00:44:08.901 --> 00:44:10.445
Turn on the mini frizzer.


00:44:29.214 --> 00:44:30.716
Superhero landing!


00:44:30.882 --> 00:44:31.842
Hooray for us!


00:44:31.883 --> 00:44:34.261
- We did it!
- It was mostly me.


00:44:34.303 --> 00:44:35.304
Yeah!


00:44:35.804 --> 00:44:36.805
What?


00:44:40.268 --> 00:44:41.519
You've got to be kidding.


00:44:41.603 --> 00:44:44.105
Finally the big guns, thank you.


00:44:44.355 --> 00:44:45.356
Fire!


00:44:53.656 --> 00:44:54.658
Fire!


00:45:00.581 --> 00:45:02.125
Ooh, close.


00:45:02.458 --> 00:45:04.252
The cannonball. Not you.


00:45:04.961 --> 00:45:07.296
Timeout, timeout.
Everyone, timeout.


00:45:07.671 --> 00:45:10.967
You almost blew her up, and she can't
come to my party if you blow her up.


00:45:11.009 --> 00:45:12.135
Sorry, sir.


00:45:12.511 --> 00:45:13.970
Alright. Time back in.


00:45:14.971 --> 00:45:16.181
Surrender monsters!


00:45:16.223 --> 00:45:17.391
No! Wait!


00:45:49.926 --> 00:45:51.260
Oh. That's pretty cool.


00:45:59.142 --> 00:46:01.062
Everyone inside. And hurry!


00:46:15.035 --> 00:46:17.455
You messed with the wrong prince.


00:46:17.621 --> 00:46:20.290
There is nothing average about Avv-vous-rarge.


00:46:20.498 --> 00:46:23.753
I shall return!


00:46:23.962 --> 00:46:24.879
On Tuesday.


00:46:24.921 --> 00:46:27.256
No, wait. I'll check my calendar...


00:46:27.298 --> 00:46:31.386
Thursday, I shall return Thursday!


00:46:32.762 --> 00:46:34.013
We'll be ready.


00:46:34.055 --> 00:46:34.848
And waiting.


00:46:34.931 --> 00:46:35.890
Arrivederci!


00:46:35.932 --> 00:46:36.934
Ciao for now!


00:46:37.017 --> 00:46:37.768
Bye bye!


00:46:37.893 --> 00:46:39.519
You just got dwarfed!


00:46:39.644 --> 00:46:41.688
Is that better? I think Merlined is better.


00:46:57.915 --> 00:47:02.461
You should have seen the look on his big
ugly face when bunny came running at him.


00:47:03.504 --> 00:47:05.673
That's how you see everything, isn't it?


00:47:05.715 --> 00:47:07.008
With my eyes?


00:47:07.216 --> 00:47:10.094
You always talk about
what someone looks like.


00:47:10.177 --> 00:47:12.680
I do? I wouldn't say that.


00:47:12.722 --> 00:47:15.308
But I can't wait for you
to see the real me.


00:47:15.600 --> 00:47:17.477
What kind of Merlin is the real you?


00:47:17.685 --> 00:47:19.103
You might not believe it,


00:47:19.186 --> 00:47:22.733
but the real me is famous,
handsome, and even popular.


00:47:22.900 --> 00:47:25.861
Not short, stumpy and green.


00:47:25.986 --> 00:47:29.282
Yeah, you're short, stumpy and green, but


00:47:29.323 --> 00:47:32.243
you're also a wonderful and charming person.


00:47:32.285 --> 00:47:33.786
I'm not explaining it right.


00:47:33.869 --> 00:47:37.457
If you saw the real me,
you'd know exactly what I mean.


00:47:38.290 --> 00:47:40.250
I think I can see the real you.


00:47:40.876 --> 00:47:44.088
And I like you, just as you are.


00:47:45.965 --> 00:47:47.258
That's hilarious.


00:47:47.550 --> 00:47:51.388
Here, close your eyes,
and imagine the real me.


00:47:51.888 --> 00:47:54.390
I guarantee you, it'll be different.


00:47:56.060 --> 00:47:59.688
I do feel something different ..


00:47:59.897 --> 00:48:00.898
Really?


00:48:01.106 --> 00:48:03.318
But eyes opened or closed


00:48:03.401 --> 00:48:05.653
to me you're still Merlin.


00:48:07.029 --> 00:48:11.577
Now tell me, who am I to you?


00:48:12.160 --> 00:48:13.704
You're a gift.


00:48:13.829 --> 00:48:18.042
A gift that'll transform me
into someone amazing.


00:48:18.750 --> 00:48:20.836
Just like you're amazing.


00:48:29.095 --> 00:48:32.140
Actually, I want to show you something too.


00:48:36.728 --> 00:48:38.145
You need a hand?


00:48:38.271 --> 00:48:41.650
Hold on. Nope. Stand back. I got this.


00:48:42.275 --> 00:48:43.819
...One...


00:48:43.861 --> 00:48:45.612
Two, yeah, okay, I need help.


00:49:03.924 --> 00:49:05.425
Woah. Woah woah woah.


00:49:05.425 --> 00:49:07.219
No thank you.


00:49:13.308 --> 00:49:16.479
You know what the weird thing is?
They're super comfortable.


00:49:18.732 --> 00:49:22.067
Y'know, I'm just saying. Where were
you when the facade was falling?


00:49:22.109 --> 00:49:24.237
I mean, that was terrifying.


00:49:26.071 --> 00:49:27.156
What're you doing here?


00:49:29.158 --> 00:49:31.077
I have come for my shoes.


00:49:31.369 --> 00:49:35.748
Well, I had them. I mean I saw them.
But those dwarfs!


00:49:35.748 --> 00:49:38.294
It's dwarves with a 'v'.
So you failed?


00:49:39.003 --> 00:49:43.006
I did not fail, I took a timeout.


00:49:43.089 --> 00:49:45.092
Yeah. This is a calculated timeout.


00:49:45.134 --> 00:49:47.261
I'm going to return on Thursday,
we all pencilled it in.


00:49:47.386 --> 00:49:48.387
Silence!


00:49:48.680 --> 00:49:50.181
Have a bite.


00:49:50.723 --> 00:49:52.184
For strength.


00:49:52.850 --> 00:49:57.021
Apples, the most suspicious of fruits.


00:49:57.063 --> 00:49:59.733
I don't have much time, Prince.


00:50:00.025 --> 00:50:04.029
You could still have the
best birthday ever,


00:50:04.196 --> 00:50:05.656
But remember...


00:50:05.698 --> 00:50:12.330
What's bad for me,
will be very bad for you.


00:50:18.419 --> 00:50:19.420
She's gone.


00:50:20.630 --> 00:50:22.925
Ah! What's the worst that could happen.


00:50:26.970 --> 00:50:27.971
It's kind of sweet.


00:50:44.240 --> 00:50:45.241
Don't move.


00:50:45.366 --> 00:50:45.907
Okay.


00:50:45.949 --> 00:50:48.034
Pino, Noki Kio, show us what you got.


00:50:48.076 --> 00:50:48.994
Okey doky!


00:50:49.035 --> 00:50:49.828
Here we go!


00:50:49.870 --> 00:50:50.997
Our pleasure.


00:50:58.255 --> 00:51:00.757
...here we go, yeah, a little


00:51:00.757 --> 00:51:01.924
Oooh a little over here!


00:51:18.650 --> 00:51:20.444
Now that looks like a real home.


00:51:20.486 --> 00:51:22.445
Yep. I could get used to that.


00:51:22.655 --> 00:51:23.864
Uh uh. I cannot.


00:51:27.535 --> 00:51:30.538
It's a perfect copy of my drawing.
That's incredible.


00:51:31.872 --> 00:51:33.123
Let me try.


00:51:34.293 --> 00:51:36.628
This will definitely make it easier to
find your dad.


00:51:36.711 --> 00:51:39.005
Unfortunately, this thing aint flying.


00:51:39.047 --> 00:51:39.881
It's grounded.


00:51:39.923 --> 00:51:40.925
Why does it need to fly?


00:51:40.966 --> 00:51:43.718
The posters are no good if we
can't distribute them fast.


00:51:43.969 --> 00:51:47.889
Guys, thank you so much for
everything you're doing.


00:51:48.391 --> 00:51:50.393
- My pleasure.
- It's nice.


00:52:59.966 --> 00:53:01.010
Opening doors!


00:53:17.068 --> 00:53:20.280
You know Merlin, I feel so
lucky that I've met you.


00:53:20.989 --> 00:53:22.866
I feel the same way.


00:53:23.284 --> 00:53:26.620
I feel like anything is possible.


00:53:27.954 --> 00:53:29.414
♪ Darling


00:53:31.125 --> 00:53:34.962
♪ Come on out there and take my hand


00:53:35.296 --> 00:53:39.092
♪ I will show you that I'm your man


00:53:39.176 --> 00:53:42.094
♪ Is that okay


00:53:42.887 --> 00:53:45.015
Merlin! Watch out!


00:53:56.026 --> 00:53:57.445
Merlin.


00:53:59.280 --> 00:54:00.323
Merlin.


00:54:01.616 --> 00:54:02.617
Merlin!


00:54:03.034 --> 00:54:04.535
Everything okay?


00:54:04.953 --> 00:54:06.163
Of course! Sure!


00:54:06.956 --> 00:54:08.207
Nothing to be embarrassed about.


00:54:08.248 --> 00:54:12.461
So why are we even talking about
that when we should be going...


00:54:12.502 --> 00:54:13.504
this direction.


00:54:13.671 --> 00:54:14.672
Hey wait!


00:54:18.383 --> 00:54:21.304
So, about these magic shoes.


00:54:21.471 --> 00:54:22.680
Why, are they still bothering you?


00:54:22.722 --> 00:54:24.724
What kind of magic do
those shoes have?


00:54:25.100 --> 00:54:28.103
Well .. How do I put this.


00:54:28.312 --> 00:54:32.064
Merlin, I used to be strong, really strong.


00:54:32.482 --> 00:54:34.692
And, I was always proud of that.


00:54:34.734 --> 00:54:39.780
But, the shoes magic, umm,
it made me a little dainty?


00:54:39.906 --> 00:54:40.949
Sorry to hear.


00:54:40.991 --> 00:54:45.287
The shoes made me lose
a little bit of weight.


00:54:45.496 --> 00:54:46.705
It could be worse.


00:54:46.747 --> 00:54:48.081
...Okay.


00:54:49.082 --> 00:54:50.668
- A lot of weight.
- Ah.


00:54:51.753 --> 00:54:55.881
Well, I know what it's like to look different on
the outside from what you feel on the inside.


00:55:00.553 --> 00:55:04.600
Merlin, I'd like to give you a
token of my appreciation.


00:55:06.018 --> 00:55:08.020
Oh, here, hand me one of your spells.


00:55:08.228 --> 00:55:08.729
Why?


00:55:08.771 --> 00:55:11.399
Oh, come on. I'm not going to zap you.


00:55:12.608 --> 00:55:13.609
Give me a second.


00:55:26.040 --> 00:55:29.918
There. Consider it your good luck charm.


00:55:33.381 --> 00:55:34.465
Thank you.


00:55:41.014 --> 00:55:44.809
Merlin, do you think we'd be happier


00:55:45.101 --> 00:55:47.312
if we were our old selves again?


00:55:47.478 --> 00:55:50.231
Yep. Yep, yep. Definately we would.


00:55:50.399 --> 00:55:51.650
I don't know.


00:55:52.776 --> 00:55:54.360
I like how we are.


00:55:55.112 --> 00:55:58.490
Right here, just, right now.


00:55:59.158 --> 00:56:02.870
Even if I'm an ugly green monster?


00:56:04.372 --> 00:56:07.959
I don't care about your height
or what colour you are.


00:56:08.876 --> 00:56:12.422
And that's the way you feel about me, right?


00:56:12.547 --> 00:56:15.674
Yes, of course. I mean, duhh!


00:56:17.344 --> 00:56:21.138
I think we're both just trapped
under the same spell.


00:56:37.406 --> 00:56:43.537
Wait. Keep your eyes closed
and don't open them until I say.


00:56:43.705 --> 00:56:45.791
When you open your eyes there will be...


00:56:46.000 --> 00:56:48.668
a handsome man in front of you.


00:56:48.710 --> 00:56:50.170
Someone worthy of you.


00:56:50.212 --> 00:56:52.422
Someone you'd be proud to be seen with.


00:56:53.633 --> 00:56:54.800
I think you're right.


00:56:54.884 --> 00:56:57.427
Ready? And...


00:56:57.762 --> 00:57:00.932
Oh, it's such a good day to break a curse!


00:57:03.434 --> 00:57:04.435
Now!


00:57:04.894 --> 00:57:06.062
Ta-da!


00:57:06.229 --> 00:57:09.232
You just got Merlined!


00:57:09.441 --> 00:57:10.609
What do you think?


00:57:11.026 --> 00:57:14.279
Mission impossibly handsome, right?


00:57:16.032 --> 00:57:19.410
Oh, it's okay,
I know this is a lot to take in.


00:57:19.743 --> 00:57:22.289
But you can let your happiness flag fly.


00:57:22.330 --> 00:57:26.250
This, this is the real me.


00:57:27.168 --> 00:57:29.254
- It's stupid.
- What?


00:57:30.422 --> 00:57:31.631
Wait a minute!


00:57:32.090 --> 00:57:34.634
My hands are still green sausages.


00:57:35.760 --> 00:57:37.930
No! I look the same.


00:57:38.181 --> 00:57:40.724
Yes, impossibly handsome.


00:57:40.766 --> 00:57:42.935
This doesn't make sense.


00:57:43.060 --> 00:57:46.064
You're the most beautiful woman in
the world, why do I look the same?


00:57:46.272 --> 00:57:48.191
What're you talking about, Merlin?


00:57:48.232 --> 00:57:49.650
Do I need a longer kiss?


00:57:50.109 --> 00:57:51.111
Two kisses?


00:57:51.987 --> 00:57:53.572
Let's try again.


00:57:54.114 --> 00:57:55.114
Umm.


00:57:55.114 --> 00:57:56.533
You're not making any sense.


00:58:05.792 --> 00:58:06.793
Hurry!


00:58:08.753 --> 00:58:09.754
What is that?


00:58:10.046 --> 00:58:12.632
This kingdom has a serious
monster problem.


00:58:28.525 --> 00:58:29.067
Are you alright?


00:58:29.109 --> 00:58:31.027
No. I'm not.


00:58:39.536 --> 00:58:40.162
Thank you.


00:58:40.204 --> 00:58:41.455
Pleasure, milady.


00:58:43.791 --> 00:58:44.792
Watch out!


00:59:02.436 --> 00:59:04.480
Ha-hah! Yes!


00:59:10.569 --> 00:59:13.031
What do they want,
besides smashing us?


00:59:13.073 --> 00:59:14.073
I don't know!


00:59:23.083 --> 00:59:24.626
The old me would've nailed that.


00:59:33.136 --> 00:59:34.513
You just got Merlined!


00:59:45.481 --> 00:59:46.482
Hurry!


01:00:01.874 --> 01:00:03.335
Red, close your eyes.


01:00:03.376 --> 01:00:05.211
This is no time for kissing, Merlin.


01:00:05.252 --> 01:00:07.379
Trust me. Close your eyes.


01:00:08.590 --> 01:00:10.258
Please, close them!


01:00:14.930 --> 01:00:16.349
That was too close.


01:00:17.141 --> 01:00:18.559
Don't look at me.


01:00:18.726 --> 01:00:20.728
You see that tree on the
other side of the bridge?


01:00:20.769 --> 01:00:21.354
Yeah.


01:00:21.395 --> 01:00:24.398
On my signal, run towards
it as fast as you can.


01:00:24.440 --> 01:00:25.942
No, I can't leave you here.


01:00:26.109 --> 01:00:29.320
You have to.
And don't look back, okay?


01:00:29.487 --> 01:00:31.865
Look right at that tree until I say it's safe.


01:00:31.990 --> 01:00:33.575
Promise you won't look.


01:00:33.617 --> 01:00:36.077
Okay. I promise.


01:00:36.661 --> 01:00:37.662
Now!


01:01:09.155 --> 01:01:10.156
What?


01:01:10.197 --> 01:01:12.491
You just got Merlined?
Oh. Yes you did.


01:01:41.522 --> 01:01:43.231
Hey! Locate!


01:01:44.275 --> 01:01:46.027
Hey, locate here!


01:01:46.319 --> 01:01:49.363
You're even more of a blockhead
than Prince Average.


01:01:51.575 --> 01:01:54.035
Avv-vous-rarge!


01:01:54.328 --> 01:01:55.787
Prince Average?


01:02:12.054 --> 01:02:13.640
You just got Merlined.


01:02:17.227 --> 01:02:18.561
Take a look, Red Shoes.


01:02:18.895 --> 01:02:19.437
Merlin!


01:02:19.479 --> 01:02:21.941
I have triumphantly saved the day.


01:02:23.109 --> 01:02:24.110
Merlin, no!


01:02:26.528 --> 01:02:27.822
Merlin!


01:02:32.660 --> 01:02:33.953
Merlin!


01:03:38.772 --> 01:03:40.274
Snow White?


01:03:49.784 --> 01:03:51.452
Snow White?


01:03:51.786 --> 01:03:54.664
The thief was Snow White
this whole time?


01:03:54.748 --> 01:03:58.251
Interesting. She could remove the shoes.


01:04:00.044 --> 01:04:02.506
You're going after her yourself?


01:04:02.590 --> 01:04:04.132
What? Were you going to go?


01:04:04.842 --> 01:04:07.344
I get it! I don't have legs.


01:04:09.931 --> 01:04:13.309
So, here I am.


01:04:14.393 --> 01:04:15.561
All the real me.


01:04:17.189 --> 01:04:18.607
I bet you're disappointed, huh?


01:04:18.815 --> 01:04:21.860
You're the girl from Golden Goose Avenue.


01:04:21.901 --> 01:04:22.443
Red Shoes!


01:04:22.486 --> 01:04:25.823
That's not my name, it's Snow White.


01:04:25.948 --> 01:04:28.450
Princess Snow White? So your father is...


01:04:28.492 --> 01:04:30.911
King White, yeah.


01:04:31.246 --> 01:04:34.790
By the time I figured out his
new wife Regina was a witch


01:04:35.833 --> 01:04:37.669
he'd already disappeared.


01:04:38.211 --> 01:04:40.714
And the monsters who attacked us


01:04:40.756 --> 01:04:44.760
were sent by my stepmother
to get these shoes.


01:04:46.053 --> 01:04:49.014
I guess being beautiful is really
worth that much to her.


01:04:49.348 --> 01:04:52.267
Have you thought about
just giving them back?


01:04:53.268 --> 01:04:54.895
And give up their magic?


01:04:56.104 --> 01:04:59.691
If I'd given up their magic, you wouldn't
have helped me find my father, would you?


01:05:00.651 --> 01:05:01.986
Would you?


01:05:05.781 --> 01:05:08.242
I thought we were both
under the same spell.


01:05:09.494 --> 01:05:12.789
But I see now that I was wrong.


01:05:13.205 --> 01:05:18.711
Listen, I can't get into all the details,
but I'm under a curse too.


01:05:19.129 --> 01:05:21.048
You still don't get it, Merlin.


01:05:22.258 --> 01:05:24.760
I'm not talking about our curses.


01:05:25.469 --> 01:05:28.263
Merlin, I'm talking about
the kind of spell


01:05:29.473 --> 01:05:31.559
you never want to break.


01:06:20.278 --> 01:06:22.780
He likes you more than he likes me.


01:06:54.688 --> 01:06:58.026
What would've happened if she'd taken
off her shoes that day in the barn?


01:06:58.067 --> 01:06:59.486
You think that's important?


01:07:02.071 --> 01:07:03.824
I just wonder,


01:07:03.824 --> 01:07:06.827
what I would've done if I'd
seen the real Snow White.


01:07:07.077 --> 01:07:08.453
Seriously?


01:07:08.537 --> 01:07:10.831
It's still all about appearance for you.


01:07:11.040 --> 01:07:13.751
No! Not exactly.


01:07:14.752 --> 01:07:17.589
But I can't live looking like
you for the rest of my life


01:07:17.756 --> 01:07:22.052
Kind of proving my point, other me.
Alright. Let's try this.


01:07:22.552 --> 01:07:25.222
Who do you like more,
Snow White or Red Shoes?


01:07:25.389 --> 01:07:27.308
Easy, it's Red Shoes.


01:07:27.474 --> 01:07:30.143
Now, which of us do you
think Red Shoes likes more?


01:07:30.226 --> 01:07:31.938
Easy, it's me!


01:07:33.856 --> 01:07:36.483
Wait. No.


01:07:37.068 --> 01:07:38.235
It's...


01:07:38.610 --> 01:07:39.654
you.


01:08:01.135 --> 01:08:06.474
♪ You came in my life in a high flash of lightning


01:08:06.558 --> 01:08:11.521
♪ I covered my eyes but there's no use in hiding


01:08:11.605 --> 01:08:15.693
♪ This feeling has stuck and I couldn't say


01:08:15.776 --> 01:08:17.026
You're a gift.


01:08:17.319 --> 01:08:19.028
A gift that'll transform me


01:08:19.028 --> 01:08:21.364
into someone amazing.


01:08:21.405 --> 01:08:26.120
♪ This is the start of something so right


01:08:26.286 --> 01:08:31.167
♪ Suddenly all of the stars have aligned


01:08:31.501 --> 01:08:36.213
♪ In the right place at the right time


01:08:36.506 --> 01:08:41.552
♪ This is the start of something so right


01:08:42.387 --> 01:08:46.350
Well, I know what it's like to look different on
the outside to what we feel on the inside.


01:08:46.683 --> 01:08:51.814
♪ This is the start of something so right


01:08:56.819 --> 01:09:04.494
♪ This is the start of something so right


01:09:06.163 --> 01:09:07.330
Look at that!


01:09:12.002 --> 01:09:15.048
The shoes. You're wearing them.


01:09:15.089 --> 01:09:16.799
I thought you left.


01:09:17.008 --> 01:09:18.551
You should take them off again.


01:09:23.848 --> 01:09:24.849
I can't.


01:09:25.642 --> 01:09:28.603
You just had to make things complicated.


01:09:29.646 --> 01:09:31.023
Maybe this will help.


01:09:31.231 --> 01:09:33.567
Eat the apple, and they'll slide right off.


01:09:33.608 --> 01:09:34.734
Where did you get that?


01:09:35.026 --> 01:09:37.322
I want to help you, Snow White.


01:09:37.572 --> 01:09:38.573
Please.


01:09:45.246 --> 01:09:46.247
Red Shoes?


01:09:46.831 --> 01:09:47.832
Merlin?


01:09:48.749 --> 01:09:49.751
Merlin?


01:09:52.588 --> 01:09:55.048
What terrible timing you have.


01:09:58.052 --> 01:10:00.053
We're gonna have to do this the hard way.


01:10:00.762 --> 01:10:01.762
Regina?


01:10:05.184 --> 01:10:08.144
Such a tender family reunion.


01:10:08.479 --> 01:10:10.606
So sad we can't stay!


01:10:11.441 --> 01:10:12.525
Red Shoes!


01:10:14.986 --> 01:10:16.904
Come on, let's go, longears.


01:10:16.946 --> 01:10:18.489
Hey! Wait for us!


01:10:18.530 --> 01:10:20.575
How 'bout you go back
and get the others?


01:10:20.742 --> 01:10:22.702
And make lots of copies of this.


01:10:23.286 --> 01:10:24.287
Let's go!


01:10:26.790 --> 01:10:28.125
We can do this.


01:10:28.166 --> 01:10:29.167
Yeah!


01:10:31.586 --> 01:10:34.048
Your power my lady. It has drained you.


01:10:34.132 --> 01:10:38.010
You think? I don't need
you to tell me how I look.


01:10:38.177 --> 01:10:40.388
I'm a mirror. It's what I do.


01:10:40.430 --> 01:10:43.307
M - I - R - O - R.
I can't spell.


01:10:43.349 --> 01:10:44.350
Enough.


01:10:45.518 --> 01:10:46.770
Bind her.


01:10:47.813 --> 01:10:49.940
It's snack time.


01:10:53.568 --> 01:10:55.780
How can you sleep at
a time like this?


01:10:57.448 --> 01:11:00.117
I'm not supposed to talk
when I have this on,


01:11:00.159 --> 01:11:03.579
but I got to ask.
Do you think they've kissed yet?


01:11:03.663 --> 01:11:04.664
I hope so,


01:11:04.748 --> 01:11:07.708
because it'll feel better to
punch Merlin when he's pretty.


01:11:08.918 --> 01:11:12.088
We've been waiting for a...
Where have you been?


01:11:12.130 --> 01:11:13.131
Did you break the curse yet?


01:11:13.173 --> 01:11:14.841
Merlin, are you hungry?


01:11:15.050 --> 01:11:16.176
Those are bears.


01:11:16.217 --> 01:11:17.219
Ah...


01:11:17.219 --> 01:11:20.097
Hi? This is from Merlin.


01:11:38.492 --> 01:11:40.453
Wow! This is so cool.


01:11:44.331 --> 01:11:45.707
Okay, sword.


01:11:45.874 --> 01:11:50.671
If you think you've humiliated, embarrassed,
and otherwise frustrated me,


01:11:51.171 --> 01:11:52.339
you're right.


01:11:52.840 --> 01:11:56.510
But that ends now!


01:12:06.104 --> 01:12:08.148
Oh, zut alors. Please end this.


01:12:19.785 --> 01:12:23.874
Hey! Wait! You're running the wrong way.


01:12:23.915 --> 01:12:25.250
The castle's over there.


01:12:42.184 --> 01:12:43.185
Sit.


01:12:54.823 --> 01:12:58.661
Eat this darling, and you'll
get your freedom.


01:12:58.827 --> 01:13:00.163
Where is my father?


01:13:00.829 --> 01:13:04.833
Royal loyal little girl,
pining for her papa?


01:13:05.250 --> 01:13:09.547
This is getting a little boring, so I need
you to take a bite, and I'll tell you.


01:13:09.673 --> 01:13:11.090
I won't let you win.


01:13:11.507 --> 01:13:14.970
You've torn apart my family,
and you will not get away with it, Regina.


01:13:16.013 --> 01:13:18.848
Ooh, I'm so scared, Snow.


01:13:19.140 --> 01:13:22.102
Very well. A different approach.


01:13:30.777 --> 01:13:31.778
- Merlin!
- No!


01:13:32.237 --> 01:13:34.782
Eat the apple, or watch him die.


01:13:34.949 --> 01:13:35.825
That's your choice.


01:13:35.866 --> 01:13:37.743
Don't do it. No!


01:13:37.785 --> 01:13:39.662
No!


01:13:41.121 --> 01:13:42.123
Red Shoes!


01:13:42.123 --> 01:13:44.375
Promise to me, you'll let him go.


01:13:44.542 --> 01:13:47.837
Oh absolutely.
When the third bell chimes,


01:13:48.046 --> 01:13:50.966
everything will be just
like it used to be.


01:13:51.091 --> 01:13:53.385
No! No no no.


01:13:55.596 --> 01:13:57.389
Save my papa for me.


01:14:07.859 --> 01:14:09.361
Red Shoes!


01:14:24.167 --> 01:14:28.798
A legendary handsome knight,
fearless rescuer of princesses.


01:14:28.923 --> 01:14:34.013
Sitting in a tree,
not getting K - I - S - I - N - G - D.


01:14:35.180 --> 01:14:36.848
Burn. I can't spell.


01:14:39.183 --> 01:14:40.645
You don't have to do this.


01:14:40.686 --> 01:14:42.772
Just take the shoes and let us go.


01:14:43.230 --> 01:14:45.983
I wish. They're made of pure magic apple.


01:14:46.108 --> 01:14:49.112
The fruit of temptation and want.
They feed on your desires


01:14:49.154 --> 01:14:53.616
Once they give you what you desire,
the bond is permanent.


01:14:53.824 --> 01:14:56.077
That's not true. She took
them off in the river.


01:14:56.161 --> 01:14:57.829
That doesn't make any sense.


01:14:57.871 --> 01:15:02.501
How could she possibly want to save you
more than she wanted to be beautiful?


01:15:02.752 --> 01:15:04.837
What did you do to her?


01:15:05.087 --> 01:15:07.006
Did you cast a spell?


01:15:09.134 --> 01:15:10.676
What's going to happen to her?


01:15:10.717 --> 01:15:15.639
Well, once she eats the apple, its magic
will turn her into a magic apple tree.


01:15:15.681 --> 01:15:18.768
The first bell, nothing really happens,
but very dramatic.


01:15:18.976 --> 01:15:21.270
The tree bears fruit,
and the second bell...


01:15:21.312 --> 01:15:23.523
Oh! Excitement mounts!


01:15:23.773 --> 01:15:25.733
The morning sun touches the fruit


01:15:25.858 --> 01:15:28.445
turning it into a new
pair of red shoes


01:15:28.486 --> 01:15:31.448
And number three, the circle of life!


01:15:31.824 --> 01:15:32.825
And then what?


01:15:32.950 --> 01:15:36.453
Regina will be the most
beautiful person in the kingdom.


01:15:36.829 --> 01:15:37.745
Forever.


01:15:37.787 --> 01:15:40.666
I don't care about her,
what about Snow White?


01:15:40.833 --> 01:15:45.045
The tree withers and dies,
and so does Snow White.


01:15:45.087 --> 01:15:46.881
No!


01:15:47.006 --> 01:15:48.717
Yes!


01:15:49.508 --> 01:15:53.263
Oh, I'm rotten! I'm dying.


01:16:10.156 --> 01:16:12.992
Why don't you come back and play?


01:16:19.332 --> 01:16:20.709
Not so fast.


01:16:30.470 --> 01:16:31.596
It's gonna hurt.


01:16:35.266 --> 01:16:38.311
Oh yeah! Stretch it out.


01:16:49.907 --> 01:16:51.117
Uh-oh.


01:16:55.412 --> 01:16:56.579
Smoke! Smoke!


01:16:56.788 --> 01:16:58.749
We're here, bitch. Are you okay?


01:16:58.791 --> 01:17:00.251
Yeah.


01:17:00.834 --> 01:17:02.836
I never thought I'd say this,


01:17:03.546 --> 01:17:05.840
but I'm so glad to be chubby
and green again.


01:17:06.633 --> 01:17:09.844
Seven to one.
I like those odds.


01:17:10.053 --> 01:17:11.095
Let's go.


01:17:13.057 --> 01:17:15.059
We like those odds even better.


01:17:17.894 --> 01:17:19.647
Are you up to this, muchacho?


01:17:20.815 --> 01:17:23.192
You finally pulled out Excalibur.


01:17:23.317 --> 01:17:27.447
Oh, yes, yes. I did it.
That's exactly how it went down.


01:17:27.488 --> 01:17:29.740
Here you go Merlin.
You're gonna need these.


01:17:29.782 --> 01:17:30.783
Thanks.


01:17:36.498 --> 01:17:38.792
Here comes the sun.


01:17:39.250 --> 01:17:41.086
Now let's all get dwarfed.


01:17:45.007 --> 01:17:49.512
Ah, this is where your
fairy tale ends, trolls.


01:17:54.141 --> 01:17:55.142
You missed.


01:18:32.016 --> 01:18:33.768
Au revoir, mirror!


01:18:48.866 --> 01:18:50.118
Finally.


01:18:58.794 --> 01:19:01.505
It's a good day to break a curse.


01:19:03.174 --> 01:19:05.384
Eternal Beauty.


01:19:18.606 --> 01:19:19.607
I'm sorry


01:19:20.150 --> 01:19:21.484
Snow White.


01:19:24.572 --> 01:19:27.783
Ahhh!


01:19:54.812 --> 01:19:57.523
Extraordinary! No more carrots for me.


01:20:03.905 --> 01:20:04.865
Woah! We're back!


01:20:04.906 --> 01:20:05.949
Yippee!


01:20:16.377 --> 01:20:17.378
Papa?


01:20:27.513 --> 01:20:28.890
Snow White?


01:20:31.183 --> 01:20:32.268
Oh papa!


01:20:32.394 --> 01:20:33.394
Snow!


01:20:38.650 --> 01:20:39.651
Wait.


01:20:39.817 --> 01:20:41.069
Where's Merlin?


01:20:41.194 --> 01:20:42.862
I'm so sorry.


01:20:43.322 --> 01:20:47.284
He sacrificed himself to stop Regina.


01:20:47.743 --> 01:20:49.411
Merlin, no!


01:20:52.456 --> 01:20:54.000
Merlin!


01:21:54.522 --> 01:21:56.150
I thought you were gone.


01:21:56.985 --> 01:22:01.280
You're the most beautiful
woman in the world.


01:22:03.116 --> 01:22:05.618
With my eyes open


01:22:07.370 --> 01:22:08.829
or closed.


01:22:20.133 --> 01:22:21.134
No.


01:22:38.528 --> 01:22:40.363
I got Merlined.


01:23:05.557 --> 01:23:07.184
You're a prince, Merlin.


01:23:14.775 --> 01:23:17.445
Yeah, that Merlin.


01:23:17.862 --> 01:23:20.864
The one who's not really your type.


01:23:24.619 --> 01:23:27.205
I kind of liked the short
and green Merlin.


01:23:29.624 --> 01:23:32.169
But I'm still that Merlin inside.


01:23:33.253 --> 01:23:35.880
Yes, yes you are.


01:23:54.442 --> 01:23:56.068
Any idea who that girl is?


01:24:07.873 --> 01:24:10.041
♪ I'm feeling good today


01:24:11.252 --> 01:24:13.755
♪ Aint nothing standing in my way


01:24:13.755 --> 01:24:15.965
♪ I wouldn't change a thing


01:24:15.965 --> 01:24:19.468
♪ I must get hot walking in a dream


01:24:19.468 --> 01:24:22.973
♪ Everybody wants to stop and stare


01:24:22.973 --> 01:24:25.975
♪ People talk but I don't care


01:24:25.975 --> 01:24:29.480
♪ Everybody wants to stop and stare


01:24:29.480 --> 01:24:32.483
♪ People talk but I don't care


01:24:32.483 --> 01:24:35.444
♪ Don't matter what you think or see


01:24:35.486 --> 01:24:38.447
♪ There's no-one I would rather be


01:24:38.447 --> 01:24:41.450
♪ Take me as I am this is me


01:24:41.450 --> 01:24:44.454
♪ There's no-one I would rather be


01:24:45.455 --> 01:24:47.290
♪ It don't matter


01:24:48.291 --> 01:24:50.460
♪ It don't matter to me


01:24:51.378 --> 01:24:53.172
♪ It don't matter


01:24:53.172 --> 01:24:56.175
♪ Take me as I am this is me


01:24:56.175 --> 01:24:58.178
♪ I learned to let it go


01:24:59.262 --> 01:25:01.096
♪ 'Cause I'm comfortable


01:25:02.097 --> 01:25:03.891
♪ In my own skin


01:25:04.392 --> 01:25:07.395
♪ I learned to dance in the suits I'm in


01:25:07.395 --> 01:25:10.899
♪ Everybody wants to stop and stare


01:25:10.899 --> 01:25:13.860
♪ People talk but I don't care


01:25:13.902 --> 01:25:17.072
♪ Everybody wants to stop and stare


01:25:17.072 --> 01:25:20.076
♪ People talk but I don't care


01:25:20.076 --> 01:25:23.079
♪ Don't matter what you think or see


01:25:23.079 --> 01:25:26.083
♪ There's no-one I would rather be


01:25:26.083 --> 01:25:29.085
♪ Take me as I am this is me


01:25:29.085 --> 01:25:32.087
♪ There's no-one I would rather be


01:25:33.673 --> 01:25:35.174
♪ It don't matter


01:25:36.509 --> 01:25:38.678
♪ It don't matter to me


01:25:39.678 --> 01:25:41.181
♪ It don't matter


01:25:41.181 --> 01:25:44.184
♪ Take me as I am this is me


01:25:44.184 --> 01:25:47.187
♪ I'm comfortable in my own skin


01:25:47.187 --> 01:25:50.190
♪ Learn to dance in suits I'm in


01:25:50.190 --> 01:25:51.692
♪ I'm comfortable...


01:26:09.293 --> 01:26:10.504
Huh?


01:26:20.390 --> 01:26:22.600
Ooh. Not Again!

